## Verdict and next discriminating requirement

FAIL under the preregistered literal criterion: picked colour hashes differ, so the exact
'hypothesis stops updating / hashes equal' statement is falsified. The much stronger
near-static signal must not be rewritten into a pass. Run3 also lacks a per-batch camera
VP marker, so it does not independently prove a moving capture.

Next: one delayed hotkey-triggered pair with prevSame/camera delta logged for every batch.
Compare relative change against live candidates and VP evidence; do not reuse exact hash
equality as the sole criterion.
